      "previewText": "Answer the following questions for the electrolysis of molten CrBr3 (shown in the diagram below).Which reaction occurs at the anode? Which reaction occurs at the cathode? What is the minimum voltage that must be applied to a cell containing molten CrBr3 in order for electrolysis to occur? VIf @@amps1@@ A is applied for @@time@@ minutes, what mass of Cr(s) will be produced? g CrIf @@amps2@@ A is applied to the cell, how long would it take to produce @@mass@@ g of Cr(s)?  h",
      "targeted": [],
      "transformations": [
